# When another program renames the inbox project while the panel is open, the panel no longer finds its destination and asks for a project; Tab picks it again under its new name.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Old item
Work:
END
keys q
type Keep me
see Quick Add → INBOX
outside <<END
Inbox: @inbox
	- Old item
Work:
END
status Reloaded
see Choose a project with Tab
see - Keep me
keys <Enter>
see Choose a project with Tab
keys <Tab>
see ┌Project
keys <Enter>
see Quick Add → Inbox
keys <Enter>
status Added to Inbox
quit
saved <<END
Inbox: @inbox
	- Old item
	- Keep me
Work:
END
